# SEQ held and white key 2 focuses track 2 (`watch 1`); held again with
# key 2, nothing (the focused track keeps what Capture holds); D#5 and C#5
# step to track 3 and back. Then PLAY/STOP.
--button 0.05:SEQ
--button 0.10:SEQ:0.2
--key 0.15:2:100:0.03
--button 0.40:SEQ:0.2
--key 0.45:2:100:0.03
--key 0.70:22:100:0.03
--key 0.80:20:100:0.03
--button 1.00:PLAY/STOP
